|                                              |
|o1 = kk                                       |
|                                              |
|o1 : QuotientRing                             |
+----------------------------------------------+
|i2 : S=kk[a..d]                               |
|                                              |
|o2 = S                                        |
|                                              |
|o2 : PolynomialRing                           |
+----------------------------------------------+
|i3 : i=ideal(a^2,b^2,c^2, d^2)                |
|                                              |
|             2   2   2   2                    |
|o3 = ideal (a , b , c , d )                   |
|                                              |
|o3 : Ideal of S                               |
