|                                                                        |
|o2 = S                                                                  |
|                                                                        |
|o2 : PolynomialRing                                                     |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : i=ideal(a^2,b^2,c^2, d^2)                                          |
|                                                                        |
|             2   2   2   2                                              |
|o3 = ideal (a , b , c , d )                                             |
|                                                                        |
|o3 : Ideal of S                                                         |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : betti (F=res i)                                                    |
|                                                                        |
